woman whom you|strong=\"H5414\"gave|strong=\"H5414\"to|strong=\"H5414\"be|strong=\"H5414\"with|strong=\"H6086\"me|strong=\"H5414\", she|strong=\"H1931\"gave|strong=\"H5414\"me|strong=\"H5414\"fruit|strong=\"H6086\"from|strong=\"H4480\"the|strong=\"H5414\"tree|strong=\"H6086\", and|strong=\"H6086\"I|strong=\"H5414\"ate it|strong=\"H5414\".”   \n"},{"number":13,"text":"The|strong=\"H6213\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"God|strong=\"H3068\"said to|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H6213\"woman, “What|strong=\"H4100\"have|strong=\"H3068\"you|strong=\"H6213\"done|strong=\"H6213\"?”  \nThe|strong=\"H6213\"woman said, “The|strong=\"H6213\"serpent|strong=\"H5175\"deceived|strong=\"H5377\"me|strong=\"H6213\", and|strong=\"H3068\"I|strong=\"H4100\"ate.”   \n"},{"number":14,"text":"The|strong=\"H3605\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"God|strong=\"H3068\"said to|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3605\"serpent|strong=\"H5175\",  \n“Because|strong=\"H3588\"you|strong=\"H3588\"have|strong=\"H3068\"done|strong=\"H6213\"this|strong=\"H2063\",  \nyou|strong=\"H3588\"are|strong=\"H3117\"cursed above|strong=\"H5921\"all|strong=\"H3605\"livestock,  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"above|strong=\"H5921\"every|strong=\"H3605\"animal|strong=\"H2416\"of|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3605\"field|strong=\"H7704\".  \nYou|strong=\"H3588\"shall|strong=\"H3068\"go|strong=\"H3212\"on|strong=\"H5921\"your|strong=\"H3068\"belly|strong=\"H1512\"and|strong=\"H3068\"you|strong=\"H3588\"shall|strong=\"H3068\"eat dust|strong=\"H6083\"all|strong=\"H3605\"the|strong=\"H3605\"days|strong=\"H3117\"of|strong=\"H3068\"your|strong=\"H3068\"life|strong=\"H2416\".   \n"},{"number":15,"text":"I will|strong=\"H2233\"put|strong=\"H7896\"hostility between you|strong=\"H2233\"and|strong=\"H7218\"the|strong=\"H1931\"woman,  \nand|strong=\"H7218\"between your|strong=\"H7896\"offspring|strong=\"H2233\"and|strong=\"H7218\"her|strong=\"H7896\"offspring|strong=\"H2233\".  \nHe|strong=\"H1931\"will|strong=\"H2233\"bruise|strong=\"H7779\"your|strong=\"H7896\"head|st